<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wild Oats Markets Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wild Oats Markets Inc.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montgomery Securities analyst Tom Courtney said he initiated coverage of Wild Oats Markets Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--The company runs 39 natural foods supermarkets in seven U.S. states and British Columbia in Canada.</p>
<p>--The stock was trading down 3/4 at 18-3/4.</p>
</text>
